   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Search Reveal\n\nConstruction circles expand into a search field, type your product name, and reveal an abstract graphic panel.\n\nCategory: ui-blocks. Length: 3.6 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A product introduction should begin with a search for its name.\n- A search scene needs editable copy and palette without external assets.\n\nAvoid when:\n- Words should fly and morph between phrases: use kinetic-morph-text.\n- Typing should resemble a command-line session: use terminal-simulator.\n\nVariables:\n- text (string): Text, default \"studio\"\n- field_width (number, 320-640): Field width, default 464\n- font_size (number, 18-54): Font size, default 34\n- frames_per_character (number, 1-12): Frames per character, default 4\n- show_panel (boolean): Graphic panel, default true\n- show_guides (boolean): Guides, default true\n- color (color): Text, default \"#26232b\"\n- field_color (color): Field, default \"#ffffff\"\n- ring_color (color): Rings, default \"#cbc5cf\"\n- panel_color (color): Panel, default \"#a800b7\"\n- accent_color (color): Accent, default \"#e8f99a\"\n- background_color (color): Background, default \"#f5f1f5\"\n- speed (number, 0.25-3): Speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
